{
  "_comment": [
    "The exact draft_receipt arguments that build the demo receipt, kept so the",
    "document is reproducible rather than a one-off someone poked into an editor.",
    "",
    "To rebuild: open the app with ?webmcp=shim and call",
    "  await window.__webmcpShim.call('draft_receipt', <the `arguments` below>)",
    "",
    "Order is by when you use it: count the days, pack the bag, travel, then surf.",
    "The weather block is deliberately absent — it and surf are both line charts",
    "with a three-column stat row, and on an 80mm strip they read as the same block",
    "twice. Surf is the distinctive one and the reason for the trip.",
    "",
    "The wordmark is 'Pete's' over 'Printer' because that is the two-part form the",
    "western mark is built for, and what its own suggest() returns. The renderer",
    "shouts both lines whatever case is typed."
  ],
  "tool": "draft_receipt",
  "arguments": {
    "title": "Surfing Trip",
    "blocks": [
      { "type": "logo", "name": "Pete's", "tagline": "Printer" },
      { "type": "heading", "text": "Surf trip", "size": "display" },
      { "type": "rule", "style": "solid" },

      {
        "type": "countdown",
        "event": "Wheels up",
        "date": "Thu 10 Sep · 08:20",
        "days": 7,
        "label": "days out",
        "milestones": ["Board bag", "Check in", "Car"]
      },
      { "type": "rule", "style": "dashed" },

      {
        "type": "groups",
        "title": "Packing",
        "note": "tick as you go",
        "groups": [
          { "name": "Board bag", "items": ["6-4 shortboard", "Fins + key", "Traction pad", "Board socks"] },
          { "name": "Wetsuit", "items": ["3/2 steamer", "Booties", "Wax - cool water", "Changing towel"] },
          { "name": "Carry-on", "items": ["Passport", "Adapter", "Headphones", "Sunscreen"] },
          { "name": "Before the door", "items": ["Bins out", "Thermostat down", "Water the plants"] }
        ]
      },
      { "type": "rule", "style": "dashed" },

      { "type": "heading", "text": "Getting there", "size": "section" },
      {
        "type": "facts",
        "dividers": true,
        "rows": [
          { "label": "Flight", "value": "TP204 · 08:20" },
          { "label": "Land", "value": "LIS · 11:05" },
          { "label": "Car", "value": "Terminal 1 · desk 14" },
          { "label": "Drive", "value": "LIS → Ericeira · 50 min", "emphasis": true },
          { "label": "Keys", "value": "Casa da Vaga · after 15:00" }
        ]
      },
      { "type": "rule", "style": "dashed" },

      { "type": "surf", "city": "Ericeira" }
    ]
  }
}
